  "description": "Five-control germanium Fuzz Factory, following the common three-transistor trace reproduced by Guitar Gear Finder (2020). Q1 is a 2N3904. Q2 and Q3 use the AC128 card with selected nominal forward gains of 85 and 125. Gate changes Q2 collector resistance, Comp changes Q3 emitter resistance, Drive bypasses that emitter at audio frequencies, and Stab varies the supply feed. The five pots use linear travel. Each AC128 includes 100 pF collector-base capacitance from the Holmes et al. extraction. Leakage, temperature and oscillation frequency vary between physical units.",
  "groundNode": "0",
  "inputNode": "in",
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Volume",
      "Gate",
      "Comp",
      "Drive",
      "Stab"
    ]
  },
  "name": "ZVEX Fuzz Factory",
  "outputNode": "out",
  "version": 3,
